          "function_template": "rolling_zscore_deviation",
          "fake_code": "def factor_rolling_zscore_deviation(sub_1, params):\n    input_transform = params.get(\"input_transform\", \"level\")\n    z_window = params.get(\"z_window\", 12)\n    min_periods = params.get(\"min_periods\", z_window)\n    direction = params.get(\"direction\", 1)\n    clip = params.get(\"clip\", None)\n\n    if input_transform == \"level\":\n        raw = sub_1\n    elif input_transform == \"pct_change\":\n        raw = sub_1 / sub_1.shift(1) - 1\n    elif input_transform == \"diff\":\n        raw = sub_1 - sub_1.shift(1)\n    elif input_transform == \"log_return\":\n        import numpy as np\n        raw = np.log(sub_1 / sub_1.shift(1))\n    else:\n        raise ValueError(f\"Unknown input_transform: {input_transform}\")\n\n    rolling_mean = raw.rolling(window=z_window, min_periods=min_periods).mean()\n    rolling_std = raw.rolling(window=z_window, min_periods=min_periods).std()\n    z = (raw - rolling_mean) / rolling_std\n\n    if clip is not None:\n        z = z.clip(lower=-clip, upper=clip)\n\n    factor = direction * z\n    return factor",
          "notes": "rolling z-score 衡量当前值相对过去 z_window 期均值的标准化偏离程度。\n\ninput_transform = \"level\" 时：衡量原始指标水平是否异常偏高/偏低，例如利率、估值、信用利差、PMI 等。\ninput_transform = \"pct_change\" 时：衡量指标变化率是否异常偏高/偏低，例如价格、规模、资金流、成交量等。\ninput_transform = \"diff\" 时：衡量指标绝对变化是否异常偏高/偏低，适合利率、利差、社融增量等本身可能不适合做百分比变化的变量。\ninput_transform = \"log_return\" 时：适合价格指数、汇率、大宗商品价格等连续价格序列。\n\ndirection = 1 时：z-score 越高，factor 越高。\ndirection = -1 时：z-score 越高，factor 越低，用于需要反向解释的变量。\n\nz_window 控制异常状态的判断窗口。window=6 更敏感，适合短周期变化；window=12 更平滑，适合月频或低频宏观指标。\nclip 用于限制极端值影响，例如 clip=3 表示将 z-score 限制在 [-3, 3]。"
