        {
          "function_target": "水平偏离B",
          "function_template": "level_deviation_soft_threshold",
          "fake_code": "def factor_level_deviation_soft_threshold(sub_1, params, sub_2=None):\n    import numpy as np\n\n    input_transform = params.get(\"input_transform\", \"level\")\n    threshold_mode = params.get(\"threshold_mode\", \"zscore\")\n    lookback_window = params.get(\"lookback_window\", 756)\n    min_periods = params.get(\"min_periods\", lookback_window)\n    upper = params.get(\"upper\", 0.75)\n    lower = params.get(\"lower\", 0.25)\n    threshold = params.get(\"threshold\", 1.0)\n    direction = params.get(\"direction\", 1)\n    clip = params.get(\"clip\", None)\n\n    if input_transform == \"level\":\n        raw = sub_1\n    elif input_transform == \"pct_change\":\n        change_window = params.get(\"change_window\", 20)\n        raw = sub_1 / sub_1.shift(change_window) - 1\n    elif input_transform == \"diff\":\n        diff_window = params.get(\"diff_window\", 1)\n        raw = sub_1 - sub_1.shift(diff_window)\n    elif input_transform == \"spread\":\n        raw = sub_1 - sub_2\n    else:\n        raise ValueError(f\"Unknown input_transform: {input_transform}\")\n\n    if threshold_mode == \"zscore\":\n        rolling_mean = raw.rolling(window=lookback_window, min_periods=min_periods).mean()\n        rolling_std = raw.rolling(window=lookback_window, min_periods=min_periods).std()\n        deviation = (raw - rolling_mean) / rolling_std\n        excess = np.sign(deviation) * np.maximum(np.abs(deviation) - threshold, 0)\n\n    elif threshold_mode == \"mean_std\":\n        rolling_mean = raw.rolling(window=lookback_window, min_periods=min_periods).mean()\n        rolling_std = raw.rolling(window=lookback_window, min_periods=min_periods).std()\n        deviation = raw - rolling_mean\n        excess = np.sign(deviation) * np.maximum(np.abs(deviation) - threshold * rolling_std, 0) / rolling_std\n\n    elif threshold_mode == \"absolute\":\n        deviation = raw\n        excess = np.sign(deviation) * np.maximum(np.abs(deviation) - threshold, 0)\n\n    elif threshold_mode == \"rank_band\":\n        rank = rolling_quantile_rank(raw, window=lookback_window)\n        upper_excess = np.maximum(rank - upper, 0)\n        lower_excess = np.maximum(lower - rank, 0)\n        excess = upper_excess - lower_excess\n\n    else:\n        raise ValueError(f\"Unknown threshold_mode: {threshold_mode}\")\n\n    factor = direction * excess\n\n    if clip is not None:\n        factor = factor.clip(lower=-clip, upper=clip)\n\n    return factor",
          "notes": "水平偏离B适用于长期均值有经济意义的变量，只有偏离均值（或历史分位）超过阈值才输出信号，中性区间静默。与水平偏离A的区别：A对所有偏离连续给分；B在静默区间内输出为0，只有超过阈值后才线性给分。\n\n前提假设：变量围绕一个稳定的长期均值波动，均值本身有经济锚点意义（例如美债实际利率围绕中性利率、PMI围绕荣枯线50、信用利差围绕历史正常区间）。如果变量均值持续漂移、无长期锚点，应改用趋势突破A。\n\ninput_transform 控制 raw 指标构造方式：\n- level：直接使用 sub_1 水平值，适合利率、估值、信用利差、PMI 等。\n- pct_change：sub_1 / sub_1.shift(change_window) - 1，适合价格、指数、规模类变量。\n- diff：sub_1 - sub_1.shift(diff_window)，适合利率、利差、社融增量等不适合做百分比变化的变量。\n- spread：sub_1 - sub_2，适合股息率 - 国债收益率、E/P - 债券收益率等双序列利差。\n\nthreshold_mode 控制静默区间的定义方式：\n- zscore：先标准化，再判断 abs(z) 是否超过 threshold（默认1.0）。不同量纲变量可统一处理。\n- mean_std：用原始偏离量与 threshold × rolling_std 比较，保留原始偏离的经济含义，用标准差定义噪音区。\n- absolute：直接用绝对阈值设定静默区，适合有明确经济意义边界的变量（例如涨跌幅超过1.5%才视为冲击）。\n- rank_band：在分位空间设静默区，rank > upper 或 rank < lower 才给信号。适合肥尾分布或对量纲不敏感的场合，门限含义直观（upper=0.75即历史75%分位）。\n\n核心参数：\n- threshold：zscore / mean_std / absolute 模式下的静默门限，默认1.0。\n- upper / lower：rank_band 模式下的分位门限，默认0.75 / 0.25。\n- lookback_window：归一化或分位计算的回看窗口，默认756（约3年日频）。\n- direction = 1：偏离越高factor越高；direction = -1：偏离越高factor越低，适合利率、风险、波动率等高位不利于成长的变量。\n- clip：截尾极端值，例如clip=3将输出限制在[-3, 3]。"
