        {
          "function_target": "趋势突破A",
          "function_template": "trend_breakout_band",
          "fake_code": "def factor_trend_breakout_band(sub_1, params):\n    import numpy as np\n\n    input_transform = params.get(\"input_transform\", \"level\")\n    breakout_window = params.get(\"breakout_window\", 6)\n    min_periods = params.get(\"min_periods\", breakout_window)\n    ma_window = params.get(\"ma_window\", None)\n    change_window = params.get(\"change_window\", 20)\n    diff_window = params.get(\"diff_window\", 1)\n    direction = params.get(\"direction\", 1)\n    clip = params.get(\"clip\", None)\n\n    if input_transform == \"level\":\n        raw = sub_1\n    elif input_transform == \"ma\":\n        raw = sub_1.rolling(window=ma_window, min_periods=ma_window).mean()\n    elif input_transform == \"pct_change\":\n        raw = sub_1 / sub_1.shift(change_window) - 1\n    elif input_transform == \"diff\":\n        raw = sub_1 - sub_1.shift(diff_window)\n    else:\n        raise ValueError(f\"Unknown input_transform: {input_transform}\")\n\n    rolling_high = raw.shift(1).rolling(window=breakout_window, min_periods=min_periods).max()\n    rolling_low = raw.shift(1).rolling(window=breakout_window, min_periods=min_periods).min()\n\n    upper_excess = raw - rolling_high\n    lower_excess = rolling_low - raw\n\n    signal = np.where(raw > rolling_high, upper_excess,\n             np.where(raw < rolling_low, -lower_excess, 0))\n\n    factor = direction * signal\n\n    if clip is not None:\n        factor = factor.clip(lower=-clip, upper=clip)\n\n    return factor",
          "notes": "趋势突破A适用于长期均值无稳定锚点、但近期动态高低点有技术意义的变量。只在突破过去N期高点或低点时输出信号，区间内静默。与水平偏离B的区别：B的参考基准是长期统计均值；A的参考基准是近期动态极值，不依赖均值稳定性。\n\n前提假设：变量均值持续漂移或受管制区间约束，长期均值无经济锚点意义，但近期形成的震荡区间边界有突破意义（例如USD/CNY的央行管理区间、VIX的近期震荡上緣、商品价格的近期高低点）。如果变量有稳定长期均值，应改用水平偏离B。\n\ninput_transform 控制 raw 指标构造方式：\n- level：直接使用 sub_1 水平值，适合汇率、商品价格、VIX等趋势性变量。\n- ma：先对 sub_1 做移动平均再判断突破，平滑噪音后再识别区间边界，适合日频高噪声序列。\n- pct_change：先计算变化率再判断突破，适合关注涨跌幅是否突破历史极值的场合。\n- diff：先计算差分再判断突破，适合关注变化量（而非水平）是否出现异常跳升的场合。\n\n突破判断逻辑：\n- 使用 raw.shift(1) 构造过去N期高低点，避免当期值纳入rolling max/min后永远无法严格突破。\n- raw > rolling_high：向上突破，输出正值（突破幅度）。\n- raw < rolling_low：向下突破，输出负值（突破幅度取负）。\n- 区间内：输出0，静默。\n\n核心参数：\n- breakout_window：近期高低点的回看窗口，默认6期。窗口短则信号频繁，窗口长则信号稀疏，建议根据变量频率和目标持仓周期调整。\n- ma_window：input_transform=ma时的均线窗口。\n- direction = 1：向上突破factor为正；direction = -1：向上突破factor为负，适合VIX、信用利差等高位不利于成长的变量。\n- clip：截尾极端突破幅度，避免单次异常跳升主导因子。"
        },
        {
          "function_target": "趋势加速度A",
          "function_template": "slope_accel_quadrant",
          "fake_code": "def rolling_ols_slope(series, window):\n    import numpy as np\n\n    def ols_slope(y):\n        x = np.arange(len(y))\n        return np.polyfit(x, y, 1)[0]\n\n    return series.rolling(window).apply(ols_slope, raw=True)\n\n\ndef factor_slope_accel_quadrant(sub_1, params):\n    slope_window = params.get(\"slope_window\", 60)\n    diff_window = params.get(\"diff_window\", 20)\n    rank_window = params.get(\"rank_window\", 756)\n    center = params.get(\"center\", 0.5)\n    direction = params.get(\"direction\", -1)\n    weight = params.get(\"accel_weight\", 0.5)\n\n    import numpy as np\n\n    slope = rolling_ols_slope(sub_1, window=slope_window)\n    slope_accel = slope.diff(diff_window)\n\n    s = rolling_quantile_rank(slope, window=rank_window) - center\n    a = rolling_quantile_rank(slope_accel, window=rank_window) - center\n\n    sign_s = np.sign(s)\n    raw = s + sign_s * np.abs(a) * weight\n\n    rank = rolling_quantile_rank(raw, window=rank_window)\n    factor = direction * (rank - center)\n    return factor",
          "notes": "在 OLS 斜率（趋势方向）基础上叠加加速度信息，识别四个象限：\n加速上行（s>0, a>0）→ factor 最大负 → 强偏价值\n减速上行（s>0, a<0）→ factor 小负   → 弱偏价值\n加速下行（s<0, a<0）→ factor 最大正 → 强偏成长\n减速下行（s<0, a>0）→ factor 小正   → 弱偏成长\n\naccel_weight 控制加速度相对斜率水平的权重，建议范围 [0.3, 0.7]。\ndirection = -1 时：factor > 0 推荐成长，factor < 0 推荐价值。"
